 JAK1 activity (Dooley et al. 2006). Based on studies in mice, phosphorylation of YBX1 on serine residues S32 and S36 (S30 and S34 in mouse Ybx1) by MAPK1 and/or MAPK3 (ERK2 and ERK1, respectively) is needed for the nuclear translocation of YBX1 and depends on JAK2, which may promote the interaction between YBX1 and ERKs (Jayavelu et al. 2020).", "literatureReference": [9737545, 9733228, {"dbId": 9733222, "displayName": "Y-box protein-1 is the crucial mediator of antifibrotic interferon-gamma effects", "title": "Y-box protein-1 is the crucial mediator of antifibrotic interferon-gamma effects", "journal": "J Biol Chem", "pages": "1784-95", "pubMedIdentifier": 16278212, "volume": 281, "year": 2006, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/16278212", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}], "className": "Summation", "schemaClass": "Summation"}], "reviewStatus": {"dbId": 9821383, "displayName": "three stars", "definition": "internally reviewed", "name": ["three stars"], "className": "ReviewStatus", "schemaClass": "ReviewStatus"}, "isChimeric": false, "category": "uncertain", "catalystActivity": [{"dbId": 4793923, "displayName": "protein serine/threonine kinase activity of p-T,Y MAPK dimers [cytosol]", "catalyzedEvent": [9734547], "physicalEntity": {"dbId": 1268261, "displayName": "p-T,Y MAPK dimers [cytosol]", "stId": "R-HSA-1268261", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-1268261.1", "maxDepth": 3, "name": ["p-T,Y MAPK dimers", "p-ERK dimer"], "speciesName": "Homo sapiens", "catalystActivities": [4793923], "className": "Set", "inDisease": false, "schemaClass": "DefinedSet"}, "className": "CatalystActivity", "schemaClass": "CatalystActivity"}], "input": [{"dbId": 9736840, "displayName": "YBX1 [cytosol]", "stId": "R-HSA-9736840", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-9736840.1", "maxDepth": 1, "name": ["YBX1", "YB-1", "Y box transcription factor", "Nuclease sensitive element binding protein 1", "Y box binding protein-1", "Y-box transcription factor", "CCAAT-binding t